   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "hash(key) and hash(node) share\none ring (0 to 2^32).\nA key belongs to the first node\nclockwise from it.\n\nAdd node E between A and B:\nonly keys in (A, E] move.\nAbout 1/N of keys move,\nnot almost all of them.",
   "fontSize": 16.5,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "n",
   "originalText": "hash(key) and hash(node) share\none ring (0 to 2^32).\nA key belongs to the first node\nclockwise from it.\n\nAdd node E between A and B:\nonly keys in (A, E] move.\nAbout 1/N of keys move,\nnot almost all of them.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
